# Relative gain of the readout plane vs X_DET, HIgS 2022 (all setups: Apr 130/190/250 mbar, Aug 130 mbar).
# Measured from 2-prong 16O(g,a)12C tracks (TPCReco ntuples, first chunk of each run, ~38k events):
#   Q_i = G_setup * sum_k E_ik g_k,  E_ik = SRIM energy deposit of track i in x bin k (Bragg curve).
# Normalised to <g> = 1 weighted by deposited energy. Same shape in all four setups within errors.
# Producer: WarsawTPC_Claude/code/gain_x_map.py (results/gain_x_correction.csv), 2026-11-19.
# Use: --input.gainMapFile gainMap_HIgS2022_xDET.dat (data only). Hit charge is divided by g(x).
# Columns: x_lo [mm]  x_hi [mm]  g  (g_err as comment)
